ceptable. For example, if  \"bcbc\", we can either remove 'b' at index  or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229603,"global_rank":113829,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19698},{"name":"travcunn/honeypot","owner":"travcunn","html_url":"https://github.com/travcunn/honeypot","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Python HTTP Honeypot","topics":[],"score":229601,"global_rank":113840,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19699},{"name":"bhuber/pyler","owner":"bhuber","html_url":"https://github.com/bhuber/pyler","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Project Euler Implementations in Python","topics":[],"score":229600,"global_rank":113842,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19700}]